//pypi.org/project/actdbg/\", \"relationship\": \"direct\", \"pricing\": \"Free (PyPI package)\", \"evidence\": \"Adds step-through debugging, breakpoints, and shell-at-failure-point on top of act — near-identical feature set to the idea.\" },\n    { \"name\": \"PipeStep\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/Photobombastic/pipestep\", \"relationship\": \"direct\", \"pricing\": \"Free, MIT license\", \"evidence\": \"Interactive CI pipeline debugger: pause before steps, inspect environment, drop into shell, re-run failed steps locally with Docker.\" },\n    { \"name\": \"GitLab local CI / interactive web terminal\", \"url\": \"https://docs.gitlab.com/ci/debugging/\", \"relationship\": \"adjacent\", \"pricing\": \"Included with GitLab\", \"evidence\": \"GitLab's own docs recommend running job containers locally via Rancher Desktop to replicate CI environment for debugging.\" }\n  ],\n  \"queries\": {\n    \"exa\": [\n      \"local runner replicates CI environment step-through debugging\",\n      \"run GitHub Actions locally debugger tool\",\n      \"CI pipeline debugger startup pricing developers subscription\"\n    ],\n    \"brave\": [\n      \"run CI pipeline locally debug tool\",\n      \"nektos act local github actions runner\",\n      \"local-ci.dev pricing CI local runner\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"proposed_variant\": null,\n  \"injection_seen\": []\n}\n```"
